# Patch 1/2 -- tuned CK block-scale B-preshuffle GEMM table for Qwen3-14B-FP8 on gfx950
#
# Repo:        aiter
# Base commit: d9e5ef7ce08ee7045d583aed768cff41aa9210fe
# Apply with:  cd /sgl-workspace/aiter && git apply -p1 <this file>
#
# MEASUREMENT (this patch alone, frozen server flags / env / workload, TP=1):
#   output throughput  1536.610 -> 1892.866 tok/s   +23.19%   (n=8 baseline, n=3 arm)
#   mean TTFT           8570.5  -> 5579.8 ms        -34.90%
#   mean TPOT             33.32 ->   28.38 ms       -14.82%
#   gsm8k 5-shot         0.9454 -> 0.9454           bit-identical; gate >= 0.9328
#   arms: results/gemmtune_r{1,2,3}_*   gate: eval_results/gemmtune_20260820_091030
#
# WHAT IT IS
# aiter's CK block-scale / B-preshuffle GEMM ships no tuned entry for any of this
# model's four linear shapes, so every prefill and decode GEMM fell through to
# "not found tuned config ... will use default config!". This adds the tuner's
# output for those shapes at the M values the frozen workload actually produces
# (decode M=64, prefill M=8192 and M=16384), as an additive file under
# aiter/configs/model_configs/ -- the same mechanism aiter already ships for dsv3,
# qwen3_235b, glm5.2 and mm2.5. It is picked up by the existing model_configs glob
# in aiter/jit/core.py: no environment variable and no server flag is involved.
#
# The tuner picks `ck` kernel 12/17 for the M=64 decode shapes and `cktile` for the
# large-M prefill shapes; all twelve rows tuned with errRatio 0.0 against the
# reference, which is why accuracy is unchanged to the digit.
#
# PRODUCED BY
#   python3 csrc/ck_gemm_a8w8_blockscale/gemm_a8w8_blockscale_tune.py --preshuffle \
#     -i analysis/gemm_tune/untuned_{decode,prefill}.csv -o <tuned.csv>
# All 228 decode + 456 prefill candidate timings are kept in
# analysis/gemm_tune/profile_{decode,prefill}.csv.
#
# ENGAGEMENT CHECK
#   rm -rf /tmp/aiter_configs && restart; then
#   wc -l /tmp/aiter_configs/a8w8_blockscale_bpreshuffle_tuned_gemm.csv   # 3456 -> 3468
#   grep -c "M:64, N:" /tmp/sglang_server_qwen3_14b_fp8.log               # 4 -> 0
#
#
# FULL-STACK RESULT (patches 1+2+3, interleaved A/B against the pristine stack, run last):
#   output throughput  1538.009 -> 1985.566 tok/s   +29.05%  (median of n=6 each,
#                      6/6 position-matched pairs positive, +28.91..+29.19%, arms disjoint)
#   gsm8k 5-shot       0.9454 -> 0.9454, identical on all 1319 problems
#   arms: results/stackab_{A,B}{1,2}_r{1,2,3}_*   gate: eval_results/stackab_B2_20260820_120659
#   driver: analysis/ab/run_ab_stack.sh + analysis/ab/stack_{A,B}.sh
diff --git a/aiter/configs/model_configs/a8w8_blockscale_bpreshuffle_tuned_gemm_qwen3_14b.csv b/aiter/configs/model_configs/a8w8_blockscale_bpreshuffle_tuned_gemm_qwen3_14b.csv
